{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03340","headline":"奉和幸三会寺应制 · 宋之问","name":"奉和幸三会寺应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六飞回玉辇，双树谒金仙。\n瑞鸟呈书字，神龙吐浴泉。\n净心遥证果，睿想独超禅。\n塔涌香花地，山围日月天。\n梵音迎漏彻，空乐倚云悬。\n今日登仁寿，长看法镜圆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03340.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03340","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}